 "solution": "\\(2+\\mathrm{i}^2+2\\mathrm{i}^3=2-1-2\\mathrm{i}=1-2\\mathrm{i}\\)。\n\\(|1-2\\mathrm{i}|=\\sqrt{1^2+(-2)^2}=\\sqrt5\\)，选 C。",
 "explanation": {
